/target
# 2026-08-24: `crates/embarch-core-client` builds its own `target/` when
# compiled/linted standalone from inside its own directory (no `[workspace]`
# ties it to the root's build output) — same reasoning as the bare `/target`
# above, just not root-anchored.
crates/*/target
/config.toml
/config.toml.bak*
/*.local.toml

# Cargo
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local env
.env
